inly uh pass those on either either  i will  answer them myself or i will do my best  to pass them on  again to our friends at uh corning nzm  and cis bio to make sure that uh the  answer the  question is being answered uh in the  best way possible  so with that i will turn it back over to  lindsay  great well thank you very much for  joining us today and thank you to brad  for his presentation and for taking time  to answer some questions  we will email this recorded event to all  participants if you have further  questions for our speaker or would like  more information on biotech's products  please visit our website in addition  please check out our blog like us on  facebook and follow us on twitter to  hear more about biotech webinars or to  learn about our products  and how they can help you again thanks  for joining us
 

